From: NeoDarwin
Subject: [PATCH] bsd: build ndamfi, NeoDarwin's AMFI and Image4 interface provider

XNU's code-signing path requires two interfaces that Apple's closed
AppleMobileFileIntegrity and AppleImage4 kexts register: the AMFI table
(including libTrustCache's functions) and the Image4 interface;
trust_cache_runtime_init() panics without them. It also links
trustCacheInitializeRuntime() and TCTypeConfig directly.

ndamfi (kernel/neodarwin/amfi) provides all of it: NeoDarwin's
libTrustCache over the version 1 module format and lookup Apple
published in xnu, an Image4 interface that declines Image4 objects, and
(P1-15) the entitlement members over a DER entitlements reader and
libkern OSObjects, and the code-signing MAC policy that makes
trust-cached binaries platform binaries and, under enforcement, refuses
the rest; and (P2-01) the verifier for run-time trust caches' ndsign
grants, with OpenSSH's public-domain Ed25519, and the sysctl that loads
one. The build overlays it at bsd/ndamfi (OpenSSH's ed25519.c at
bsd/ndamfi/openssh); this patch adds it to bsd's file list, and builds
nd_ed25519.c, which compiles that file unmodified, with -w. Design:
docs/kernel/amfi-provider.md.

Rebase-risk: low (nine lines in bsd/conf/files, one in
bsd/conf/Makefile.template).
---
--- a/bsd/conf/Makefile.template
+++ b/bsd/conf/Makefile.template
@@ -585,6 +585,10 @@
 #
 
 subr_prof.o_CFLAGS_RM = -pg
+
+# ndamfi's Ed25519 (bsd/ndamfi/nd_ed25519.c) compiles OpenSSH's public-domain
+# ed25519.c unmodified; it isn't written to the kernel's warning flags.
+nd_ed25519.o_CFLAGS_ADD += -w
 
 # Rebuild if per-file overrides change
 ${OBJS}: $(firstword $(MAKEFILE_LIST))
--- a/bsd/conf/files
+++ b/bsd/conf/files
@@ -434,6 +434,15 @@
 bsd/kern/kern_sfi.c			standard
 bsd/kern/kern_time.c			standard
 bsd/kern/kern_trustcache.c  standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_amfi.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_amfi_grant.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_amfi_policy.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_ed25519.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_entitlements.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_entitlements_os.cpp	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_ndsign.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_trustcache.c	standard
+bsd/ndamfi/nd_tc_lookup.c	standard
 bsd/kern/kern_codesigning.c standard
 bsd/kern/code_signing/txm.c standard
 bsd/kern/code_signing/ppl.c standard
